<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>JSON 관련 기본 API</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_5f712abbd0b93bc0" class="chapter_title">JSON 관련 기본 API</h1><h1 id="r_2f4ede43607efc1f" class="element heading1" data-element-id="2f4ede43607efc1f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><p id="r_2b52cb1b39b85616" class="element normal" data-element-id="2b52cb1b39b85616">JSON 문자열을 JSON 객체로 생성, JSON 객체를 문자열로 반환받는 예제입니다.</p><p id="r_290237906797165d" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="290237906797165d"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00036">P00036</a></p><h1 id="r_b7570dfaf23608ad" class="element heading1" data-element-id="b7570dfaf23608ad"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_8cd5e48953eabbd6" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="8cd5e48953eabbd6"><li><p>JSON 문자열을 JSON 객체로 생성하기</p></li><li><p>JSON 객체를 문자열로 반환받기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_94064cab1f1932ca" class="element heading1" data-element-id="94064cab1f1932ca"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><p id="r_dbf58d991cbb4e70" class="element normal" data-element-id="dbf58d991cbb4e70">예제 영역'로그 확인'의 textarea에 참고용 로그를 출력하고 있습니다.</p><h2 id="r_9df228842bdf2f7b" class="element heading2" data-element-id="9df228842bdf2f7b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>JSON 문자열을 JSON 객체로 생성하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_95e85c1e2ef5e1c0" class="element step1" data-element-id="95e85c1e2ef5e1c0"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">String to JSON - JSON.parse</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_303f25381903726d" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="303f25381903726d">다음의 JSON 형식의 문자열을 JSON 객체로 변환합니다.</p><div id="r_fce6893a3409efad" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="fce6893a3409efad"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>JSON 형식의 문자열</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>'{"no":"1", "name":"WebSquare"}'</pre></div><div id="r_6e4209dc226323bb" class="element step1" data-element-id="6e4209dc226323bb"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_a458d6c93fad3dbc" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="a458d6c93fad3dbc">로그 출력 영역에 로그를 확인합니다.</p><div id="r_18e2155cac833064" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="18e2155cac833064"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:02:18] ** [String to JSON - JSON.parse] scwin.btn_ex1_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:02:18] no : 1
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:02:18] name : WebSquare</pre></div><h2 id="r_5cb616df4fc97d7c" class="element heading2" data-element-id="5cb616df4fc97d7c"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>JSON 객체를 문자열로 반환받기</span></div></h2><div id="r_12558d7e9e9ffbe4" class="element step1" data-element-id="12558d7e9e9ffbe4"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">JSON to String - JSON.stringify</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_c96dae0be695fa43" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="c96dae0be695fa43">다음의 JSON 객체를 문자열로 변환합니다.</p><div id="r_b88d70678b88edc7" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="b88d70678b88edc7"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 3.</span>JSON 형식의 문자열</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>{<span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">"no"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"2"</span>, <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">"name"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"WebSquare"</span>}</pre></div><div id="r_aaf6b26ecf2d3a09" class="element step1" data-element-id="aaf6b26ecf2d3a09"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_27c34e7e4e1b4822" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="27c34e7e4e1b4822">로그 출력 영역에 로그를 확인합니다.</p><div id="r_1b8eed17db155cf8" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="1b8eed17db155cf8"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 4.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:07:21] ** [JSON to String - JSON.stringify] scwin.btn_ex2_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:07:21] JSON 문자열 : {"no":"2","name":"WebSquare"}</pre></div><h1 id="r_d3181d8f9212af5e" class="element heading1" data-element-id="d3181d8f9212af5e"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_06d565a5c7b2e993" class="element heading2" data-element-id="06d565a5c7b2e993"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>JSON 문자열을 JSON 객체로 생성하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_d7ffb6fa9014c0ce" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="d7ffb6fa9014c0ce"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 5.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> jsonStr = <span class="r_h_string_span">'{"no":"1", "name":"WebSquare"}'</span>; <span class="r_h_comment_span">//json 문자열</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> jsonObj = JSON.parse( jsonStr );    <span class="r_h_comment_span">//json 객체 생성</span></pre></div><h2 id="r_912192c849abb975" class="element heading2" data-element-id="912192c849abb975"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.2</span><span>JSON 객체를 문자열로 반환받기</span></div></h2><div id="r_e01f589aaa2f8848" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="e01f589aaa2f8848"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 6.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> jsonObj = {
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"no"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"2"</span>, 
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"name"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"Websquare"</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>};
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> jsonStr = JSON.stringify( jsonObj );</pre></div></div></body></html>